  "title": "CGI to modernize U.S. Environmental Protection Agency’s financial management systems to enhance transparency, resource planning and efficiency",
  "summary": "CGI Federal Inc. (CGI), a wholly-owned U.S. operating subsidiary of CGI Inc. (NYSE: GIB) (TSX: GIB.A), has been selected to manage and modernize the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency’s (EPA) financial management platform, called Compass, by expanding the implementation of CGI’s Momentum® Enterprise Suite.",
